  "body": "## Changelog\n* 046f1acecd0ecd25180e1b370c91a79d2acbd408: chore(release): v0.21.2 notes and release fixes (#3286) (@devarismeroxa)\n* c9064a63621e726720634f0cd7b31adab5b73cbb: docs(roadmap): lead v0.22 with migration completeness; gate the engine flip on the benchi harness (@devarispbrown)\n* 70aabfce38cb9e37ce64e7bbda8fd4a93fbad6cd: fix: restore a green main and start pipelines with the default DLQ again (#3285) (@devarismeroxa)\n\n## Release Artifacts\n\n### OSX Darwin\n\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Darwin_arm64.tar.gz](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Darwin_arm64.tar.gz)\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Darwin_x86_64.tar.gz](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Darwin_x86_64.tar.gz)\n\n### Linux\n\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Linux_arm64.deb](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Linux_arm64.deb)\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Linux_arm64.rpm](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Linux_arm64.rpm)\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Linux_arm64.tar.gz](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Linux_arm64.tar.gz)\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Linux_i386.deb](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Linux_i386.deb)\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Linux_i386.rpm](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Linux_i386.rpm)\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Linux_i386.tar.gz](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Linux_i386.tar.gz)\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Linux_x86_64.deb](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Linux_x86_64.deb)\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Linux_x86_64.rpm](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Linux_x86_64.rpm)\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Linux_x86_64.tar.gz](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Linux_x86_64.tar.gz)\n\n### Windows\n\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Windows_arm64.zip](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Windows_arm64.zip)\n- 📦 [conduit_0.21.2_Windows_x86_64.zip](https://conduit.gateway.scarf.sh/conduit/download/v0.21.2/conduit_0.21.2_Windows_x86_64.zip)\n\n## Verifying\n\n`checksums.txt` is signed with [Sigstore](https://www.sigstore.dev/) keyless signing (`checksums.txt.sigstore.json`), and each archive has an SPDX SBOM. The Docker image is signed by digest. See [Verifying a release](https://github.com/ConduitIO/conduit/blob/main/docs/releases.md#verifying-a-release).\n\n```\ncosign verify-blob \\\n  --certificate-identity 'https://github.com/ConduitIO/conduit/.github/workflows/release.yml@refs/tags/v0.21.2' \\\n  --certificate-oidc-issuer 'https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com' \\\n  --bundle checksums.txt.sigstore.json checksums.txt\nsha256sum --check --ignore-missing checksums.txt\n```\n\n## Docker images\n\nTo pull the image, you can execute the following command:\n```\ndocker pull conduit.docker.scarf.sh/conduitio/conduit:v0.21.2\n```\n![conduit-release-view](https://static.scarf.sh/a.png?x-pxid=3df89eef-1623-4cd5-9dbc-a6b36588a0eb)\n\n",
